      // see `test/fixtures/live-captured/970-i82-metadata-v4.xml` — the
      // bindingtypes endpoint itself was not re-probed on 2026-09-15.
      //
      // Pinned to `v2` (not `v1`): A4H's ADT discovery document advertises only
